{"id":"701e19aa09901897","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-term-interpretation.md","title":"Term Interpretation","display":"df-term-interpretation — Term Interpretation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-term-interpretation","aliases":["57-df-term-interpretation"],"display":"df-term-interpretation — Term Interpretation","depends_on":["[[57-df-term]]","[[57-df-assignment]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-herbrand-universe]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-term-interpretation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-term-interpretation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term-interpretation — Term Interpretation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d5f7158a321b8947\" href=\"?note=d5f7158a321b8947\" title=\"57-df-assignment\">57-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d1505219185e27a3\" href=\"?note=d1505219185e27a3\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-universe\">57-df-herbrand-universe</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d5f7158a321b8947\" href=\"?note=d5f7158a321b8947\" title=\"57-df-assignment\">57-df-assignment</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u,t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t,u,t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\">\\(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}\">\\(\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}\\)</span> 是下述结构递归的唯一函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>省略赋值的记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t^{\\mathfrak A}\">\\(t^{\\mathfrak A}\\)</span> 仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\)</span> 使用，闭项集合见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d1505219185e27a3\" href=\"?note=d1505219185e27a3\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-universe\">57-df-herbrand-universe</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Val}^0_{\\mathfrak A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Val}^0_{\\mathfrak A}\\)</span> 在下式给出其函数图。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}&amp;:\\mathrm{Term}_S\\to A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(x)&amp;=\\beta(x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(c)&amp;=c^{\\mathfrak A},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))&amp;=\nf^{\\mathfrak A}(\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t_1),\\ldots,\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t_n)),\\\\\nt^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}&amp;:\\mathrm{Term}_S\\to A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(x)&amp;=\\beta(x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(c)&amp;=c^{\\mathfrak A},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))&amp;=\nf^{\\mathfrak A}(\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t_1),\\ldots,\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t_n)),\\\\\nt^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Val}^0_{\\mathfrak A}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle t,a\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\times A:\n\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\ (\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t)=a)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Val}^0_{\\mathfrak A}&amp;:\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\to A,\\qquad\nt^{\\mathfrak A}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Val}^0_{\\mathfrak A}(t)\\quad(t\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Val}^0_{\\mathfrak A}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle t,a\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\times A:\n\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\ (\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t)=a)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Val}^0_{\\mathfrak A}&amp;:\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\to A,\\qquad\nt^{\\mathfrak A}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Val}^0_{\\mathfrak A}(t)\\quad(t\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限语法树上的结构递归保证存在唯一性；函数解释的元数和论域已给定，所以每一步均有且仅有一个论域值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"053d3ef4d2401abe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"d5f7158a321b8947","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-herbrand-universe","status":"resolved","id":"d1505219185e27a3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-herbrand-universe]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$；$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)$，见 [[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-assignment]]。$t,u,t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S$，$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S$，$n\\geq1$，$f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n$，见 [[57-df-term]]、[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。$\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}$ 是下述结构递归的唯一函数。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"d5f7158a321b8947","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$；$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)$，见 [[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-assignment]]。$t,u,t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S$，$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S$，$n\\geq1$，$f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n$，见 [[57-df-term]]、[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。$\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}$ 是下述结构递归的唯一函数。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"053d3ef4d2401abe","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$；$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)$，见 [[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-assignment]]。$t,u,t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S$，$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S$，$n\\geq1$，$f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n$，见 [[57-df-term]]、[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。$\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}$ 是下述结构递归的唯一函数。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$；$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)$，见 [[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-assignment]]。$t,u,t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S$，$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S$，$n\\geq1$，$f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n$，见 [[57-df-term]]、[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。$\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}$ 是下述结构递归的唯一函数。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-herbrand-universe","status":"resolved","id":"d1505219185e27a3","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"省略赋值的记号 $t^{\\mathfrak A}$ 仅对 $t\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)$ 使用，闭项集合见 [[57-df-herbrand-universe]]；$\\mathrm{Val}^0_{\\mathfrak A}$ 在下式给出其函数图。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"t,u,t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}","display":false},{"tex":"t^{\\mathfrak A}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Val}^0_{\\mathfrak A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}&:\\mathrm{Term}_S\\to A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(x)&=\\beta(x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(c)&=c^{\\mathfrak A},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))&=\nf^{\\mathfrak A}(\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t_1),\\ldots,\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t_n)),\\\\\nt^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Val}^0_{\\mathfrak A}&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle t,a\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\times A:\n\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\ (\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t)=a)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Val}^0_{\\mathfrak A}&:\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\to A,\\qquad\nt^{\\mathfrak A}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Val}^0_{\\mathfrak A}(t)\\quad(t\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1953,"backlinks":[{"id":"45a760524ec618ff","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"假定 $\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$、$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)$、$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$、$x\\in\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)$、$t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S$ 和 $\\mathrm{var}(t)\\cap\\mathrm{BV}(\\varphi)=\\emptyset$。上述类型和函数见 [[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-assignment]]、[[57-df-free-variable]]、[[57-df-bound-variable]]、[[57-df-var-in-term]]。满足与项解释见 [[57-df-satisfaction]]、[[57-df-term-interpretation]]；使用 [[57-df-free-for]] 和 [[57-thm-substitution-formula]]。$\\models_\\beta$ 缩写 $\\models[\\beta]$。"},{"id":"ff7a0658d8cf65f6","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"假定 $\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\neq\\emptyset$；$B_S$ 见 [[57-df-herbrand-universe]]、[[57-df-herbrand-base]]。固定参数 $I\\subseteq B_S$，表示被赋真的基关系原子。$c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S$、$f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n$、$R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n$、$n\\geq1$，见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。$\\mathfrak H(S)$ 保留原单参数写法，但其真原子集合 $I$ 是显式环境参数；$\\mathfrak H_I(S)$ 显示该参数。结构与项解释见 [[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-term-interpretation]]。"},{"id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$s,t,t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S$，$n\\geq1$，$R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n$，$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$；见 [[57-df-formula]]、[[57-df-term-interpretation]]。"},{"id":"521852a49020f617","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to A$，$\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}_S^2(\\mathfrak A)$。$P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)$ 为关系符号，$R\\subseteq A^n$ 为实际关系，$X\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2$；两者不共用一个未区分的 $R$。$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2$，$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$n\\ge1$。项解释、一阶赋值修改与二阶赋值修改分别取 [[57-df-term-interpretation]]、[[57-df-modified-assignment]]、[[57-df-so-assignment]]。递归沿二阶有限公式树进行。"},{"id":"7a2f1568ce02e54d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$。闭项集合 $\\mathrm{HU}(S)$ 见 [[57-df-herbrand-universe]]；闭项解释 $t^{\\mathfrak A}$ 见 [[57-df-term-interpretation]]。"},{"id":"51c16bf642c7ebc0","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$，$\\beta,\\beta'\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)$，$t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S$；$\\mathrm{var}$ 取 [[57-df-var-in-term]]，项解释取 [[57-df-term-interpretation]]。"},{"id":"c0fd83f07984e2fd","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count"